WEBVTT

00:12.100 --> 00:14.040
I'm sorry, Charlotte.

00:14.320 --> 00:19.030
I shouldn't have lied about being lovers if
it meant ending up in this situation.

00:19.270 --> 00:21.850
N-No, please don't worry about it.

00:22.970 --> 00:26.550
It's the first time since 
you took me on that trip...

00:33.930 --> 00:35.350
<i>What am I thinking?!</i>

00:36.070 --> 00:37.420
<i>I know!</i>

00:37.920 --> 00:41.100
<i>I should just use a spell to 
fall asleep like that time.</i>

