01:02.170 --> 01:04.810
<i>This bed had a special treatment applied...</i>

01:04.810 --> 01:06.720
<i>The only person who could do this is...!</i>

01:08.330 --> 01:12.200
Bro, I do not make the same mistake twice.

01:15.940 --> 01:18.460
Well then, the night is still young.

01:18.990 --> 01:21.710
Entertain us.

01:24.020 --> 01:28.600
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

02:52.860 --> 02:57.320
<b>Naughty Reunion</b>

02:55.770 --> 02:58.550
<i>Can I even fall 
asleep in this situation?</i>

02:58.550 --> 03:04.150
You know... your parents 
are so happily married.

03:04.150 --> 03:05.780
It surprised me.

03:06.250 --> 03:09.640
Well, I guess that's not 
always a good thing.

03:10.230 --> 03:13.280
Because of that, my future is in jeopardy.

03:14.860 --> 03:17.960
But I think they're an ideal couple.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.790
I'm very envious.

03:20.100 --> 03:22.860
<i>That's an ideal couple?</i>

03:26.220 --> 03:27.480
Charly.

03:27.480 --> 03:29.560
What's the matter, Al-Al?

03:30.150 --> 03:32.300
I wish we could be like this forever.

03:32.670 --> 03:35.370
Al-Al, you're so spoiled.

03:41.910 --> 03:46.580
Sh-Should I act more like my Uncle?

03:46.580 --> 03:50.330
Oh, that's not what I meant...

03:51.040 --> 03:52.590
Oh, my bad—

03:54.420 --> 03:56.070
Y-Yes, you're right.

03:56.070 --> 03:59.910
W-We don't need to go that far for a pretense.

04:03.100 --> 04:08.180
When we... did skits for 
Dorothea, at the end...

04:08.610 --> 04:12.610
What were you going to say to me, Allen?

04:13.950 --> 04:17.610
Um... how do you... feel about me?

04:18.080 --> 04:22.300
Charlotte, th-the truth is, I...

04:27.040 --> 04:30.340
<i>Should I give her an honest answer?</i>

04:33.110 --> 04:35.170
<i>Do I... really feel that way?</i>

04:35.520 --> 04:37.080
<i>If that's the case...</i>

04:37.650 --> 04:41.240
<i>Why do I want to hear the answer?</i>

04:42.060 --> 04:45.250
<i>I just want to see Charlotte 
every morning when I wake up...</i>

04:45.890 --> 04:47.530
Good morning.

04:47.530 --> 04:51.180
<i>...say good morning to each 
other, drink tea together,</i>

04:51.770 --> 04:56.570
<i>see flowers grow and take 
a walk or go shopping...</i>

04:57.970 --> 05:01.780
<i>I want to learn a lot of naughty things from Allen,</i>

05:02.190 --> 05:04.290
<i>eat meals together, and...</i>

05:04.630 --> 05:10.840
<i>...say good night to each other, 
and repeat days like that...</i>

05:05.570 --> 05:06.450
Good night.

05:12.630 --> 05:16.800
<i>But I can't force my selfish 
dreams on Charlotte...</i>

05:17.330 --> 05:22.040
<i>But I'm a wanted person, so I don't have 
the right to wish for such things...</i>

05:22.270 --> 05:23.550
<i>I can't.</i>

05:22.270 --> 05:23.550
<i>I can't.</i>

05:23.820 --> 05:27.560
<i>Charlotte has finally started 
to walk on her own.</i>

05:27.850 --> 05:33.550
<i>I would only be a burden to Allen, so...</i>

05:33.800 --> 05:35.310
<i>It's beyond naughty.</i>

05:33.800 --> 05:35.310
<i>It's beyond naughty.</i>

05:38.140 --> 05:38.970
<i>However...</i>

05:39.470 --> 05:41.060
E-Excuse me...

05:41.370 --> 05:43.620
I'm sorry I troubled you.

05:44.150 --> 05:46.320
You don't need to answer that.

05:46.670 --> 05:49.290
We have an early morning 
tomorrow, so let's go to sleep.

05:49.920 --> 05:51.060
S-Sure...

05:51.750 --> 05:53.310
Good night.

05:58.540 --> 06:01.490
It sounds like they went to sleep?

06:01.490 --> 06:02.830
Wait, what?!

06:02.830 --> 06:06.350
How much do you think I <i>paid</i> 
for that bed treatment?!

06:06.690 --> 06:08.040
I'll give them a piece of my mind.

06:08.040 --> 06:09.590
That might be going a bit overboard—

06:09.590 --> 06:11.530
Hey, let me go!

06:17.460 --> 06:20.360
You all need to be quiet, okay?

06:20.360 --> 06:22.120
Y-Yes...
- Y-Yes...

06:26.610 --> 06:29.380
Okay, I'll cast a spell.

06:29.380 --> 06:31.610
Thank you...

06:32.060 --> 06:33.420
Shape Shift!

