Oh, glasses?

06:44.080 --> 06:45.210
<i>I knew it...</i>

06:45.210 --> 06:47.870
<i>I... </i>love<i> it!</i>

06:48.230 --> 06:49.460
Allen?

06:50.400 --> 06:54.040
Well, since she knows what you 
look like, just in case.

06:54.040 --> 06:56.020
Th-They look great on you.

06:56.320 --> 06:59.110
That's <i>got</i> to be his personal preference.

06:59.110 --> 07:01.270
I agree with you there.

07:01.480 --> 07:04.710
Wha... T-That's absolutely not true!

07:04.710 --> 07:05.770
Oh yeah?

07:05.770 --> 07:08.120
What is <i>that</i> reaction?!

07:16.150 --> 07:20.550
I hear they loiter around here a lot.

07:21.300 --> 07:23.790
You bastard! You'll pay for this!

07:30.580 --> 07:31.970
<i>Natalia...</i>

07:35.640 --> 07:37.900
I presume you are Natalia?

07:42.990 --> 07:46.330
<i>She casually checked the 
positions of her allies nearby,</i>

07:46.330 --> 07:50.220
<i>and shifted her weight so she 
could be ready to fight.</i>

07:50.750 --> 07:54.190
<i>And she's been here for only three months?</i>

07:54.190 --> 07:55.760
<i>Just imagine what 
she could grow up to be.</i>

07:56.540 --> 07:58.070
Who are you?

07:58.420 --> 08:00.980
My name's Allen Crawford.

08:00.980 --> 08:03.320
A temporary substitute teacher.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.990
Crawford...

08:04.990 --> 08:07.850
Are you related to the headmaster?

08:07.850 --> 08:09.090
B-Boss Lady...

08:09.340 --> 08:13.850
That name is feared as the naughtiest 
kid in the history of the academy...

08:14.120 --> 08:16.920
He instantly knocked out 
professors and hundreds of students

08:16.920 --> 08:18.720
who opposed him in a second...

08:18.720 --> 08:21.430
After a battle against the headmaster 
for three days and three nights,

08:21.430 --> 08:23.570
he annihilated a whole mountain...

08:23.570 --> 08:26.060
He's the Great Demon Lord 
of the magical academy!

08:26.960 --> 08:28.980
Enough with the compliments.

08:28.980 --> 08:30.610
You're making me blush.

08:31.350 --> 08:33.810
I'm not sure if those were compliments...

08:34.070 --> 08:36.330
And who might that be?

08:36.610 --> 08:39.800
Oh, this is my assistant, Charlo.

08:39.800 --> 08:42.040
Hey, why don't you say hello?

08:42.040 --> 08:43.830
Oh, y-yes.

08:44.180 --> 08:47.580
Um, n-nice to meet you...

08:47.580 --> 08:51.330
What do the Great Demon Lord and 
his assistant want with me?

08:51.330 --> 08:53.130
A simple story.

08:53.130 --> 08:57.330
I received a request directly from the 
headmaster to instruct troubled students.

08:57.720 --> 09:01.150
Think of me as your private instructor.

09:01.150 --> 09:03.470
I do not need a private instructor.

09:03.470 --> 09:05.340
Please leave me alone.

09:05.660 --> 09:07.670
Let's go, you all.

09:07.670 --> 09:09.570
Y-Yes, Boss Lady!

09:10.560 --> 09:13.360
I guess that's what one would 
expect from the first attempt...

09:13.790 --> 09:16.860
What do you think, Charlotte... huh?!

09:16.860 --> 09:18.060
Charlotte?!

09:20.890 --> 09:25.120
I-I really got to talk to Natalia...

09:25.400 --> 09:30.120
I... I'm so glad that I decided to be brave!

09:30.520 --> 09:34.820
I'm not sure if that can be called "talk"...

09:35.210 --> 09:38.130
But you need to step up your 
game for what's to come.

09:38.820 --> 09:40.130
What's to come?

09:40.340 --> 09:43.140
Right. It'll be more than 
just a conversation.

09:43.410 --> 09:48.660
You'll be hanging out together, dining 
together, and sometimes fighting...

09:45.130 --> 09:45.990
Here.

09:46.840 --> 09:47.740
Humph!

09:48.980 --> 09:50.580
Wait, Charlotte?!

09:51.540 --> 09:53.830
Hey, Charlotte...

09:59.120 --> 10:02.160
Oh no, this is not...

10:02.160 --> 10:04.440
Not what you think!

10:05.040 --> 10:08.040
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

10:08.040 --> 10:11.040
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

10:20.060 --> 10:21.100
Hey.

10:21.100 --> 10:23.060
E-Excuse us...

10:28.280 --> 10:30.980
Five magical elemental applications, huh?

10:30.980 --> 10:32.820
Are you able to comprehend this?

10:33.100 --> 10:36.830
Professor, the formula you're 
writing right now is incorrect.

10:36.830 --> 10:39.980
If we used the electro 
magic under that condition,

10:39.980 --> 10:42.150
the power of it would have gone up more.

10:42.830 --> 10:45.860
Oh, you're correct.

10:45.860 --> 10:50.830
Forgive me, when you age, your concentration 
goes out the window, you see...

10:51.090 --> 10:53.450
I see, not bad.

10:53.450 --> 10:57.330
Your compliment doesn't bring 
me any happiness whatsoever.

11:02.560 --> 11:04.270
Hey, what's the matter?

11:04.270 --> 11:08.770
Oh, it's just that I have no 
clue what any of this means,

11:08.770 --> 11:10.860
so I'm impressed with Natalia!

11:11.170 --> 11:15.860
You're the Great Demon Lord's assistant, 
and you don't even know this?

11:15.860 --> 11:17.470
S-Sorry...

11:17.470 --> 11:20.200
My assistant is still new.

11:20.200 --> 11:24.870
She's going over the basics of magic 
while she's on this mission.

11:24.870 --> 11:25.540
I am?

11:27.610 --> 11:29.530
Y-Yes!

11:29.530 --> 11:33.130
I'm still inexperienced, 
but I will work hard!

11:33.130 --> 11:35.730
This is a good opportunity, Charlo.

11:35.730 --> 11:39.920
Why don't you ask the genius child 
over there for some lessons?

11:39.920 --> 11:40.710
What?!

11:40.710 --> 11:42.330
She's your assistant, not mine.

11:42.330 --> 11:43.650
Why should I?

11:43.650 --> 11:45.930
S-She's right, Allen.

11:45.930 --> 11:47.900
We shouldn't disturb her study.

11:48.750 --> 11:55.650
B-But, if your schedule permits it, I'd 
appreciate it if you could teach me...

11:57.340 --> 12:00.650
Then I might faint out of happiness!

12:00.650 --> 12:02.420
F-Faint?!

12:02.420 --> 12:06.410
Oh, but I'll do my best not to do that!

12:06.750 --> 12:08.650
Why would you want to...

12:09.370 --> 12:12.410
I suppose I could, during this lecture.

12:12.410 --> 12:15.140
Y-You mean it?!

12:19.420 --> 12:24.680
Th-Thank you very much for teaching me!

12:24.680 --> 12:27.170
Well, it wasn't a big deal...

12:27.480 --> 12:31.680
Why did you want to study magic, Charlo?

12:31.880 --> 12:32.620
Huh?

12:34.600 --> 12:39.550
I've always been protected by 
Allen and the others up until now.

12:39.550 --> 12:41.830
But I think I need to do more.

12:43.300 --> 12:47.890
I want to be stronger 
so I can face anything.

12:48.460 --> 12:51.090
To face anything...

12:52.340 --> 12:58.610
So, I will practice the lightning 
magic you taught me in that class!

12:58.610 --> 13:00.960
I'll do my best so I can master it!

13:00.960 --> 13:04.840
Well, that one is a rather 
difficult spell...

13:05.130 --> 13:08.340
If you get confused, I wouldn't 
mind if you ask me again.

13:08.340 --> 13:10.080
Oh, really?!

13:10.080 --> 13:11.540
Thank you so much!

13:11.540 --> 13:13.350
There's mommy!

13:15.040 --> 13:18.100
Master Allen, Miss Charlo, 
we've been looking for you.

13:18.100 --> 13:20.610
What are you two doing here?

13:22.840 --> 13:24.880
Could you be any ruder?

13:24.880 --> 13:28.480
We've brought lunch from your mother.

13:29.210 --> 13:31.880
Thank you, Gosetsu.

13:32.300 --> 13:33.620
Mommy!

13:34.360 --> 13:36.610
Oh, Lü, please stop!

13:38.110 --> 13:39.610
Check it out!

13:39.610 --> 13:40.610
What's that?

13:43.960 --> 13:46.540
A fenrir and a hell capybara?!

13:46.540 --> 13:48.880
What exactly are you?

13:48.880 --> 13:49.790
Huh?

13:51.730 --> 13:55.840
But if you have two rare 
species of magical creatures,

13:55.840 --> 13:59.900
you're already an accomplished 
magical creature tamer.

14:00.180 --> 14:02.890
Do you need to learn magic?

14:02.890 --> 14:09.150
Um... but that's only because 
Lü and Gosetsu are amazing.

14:09.150 --> 14:11.790
Ah, you are an "unaware 
protagonist" type...

14:12.930 --> 14:14.910
By the way, Natalia...

14:14.910 --> 14:17.170
is that all you're going to have for lunch?

14:17.170 --> 14:18.270
Huh?

14:18.800 --> 14:20.550
I believe the amount is sufficient.

14:21.410 --> 14:24.550
You should at least have some salad...

14:24.550 --> 14:26.590
I'll go get some!

14:27.800 --> 14:28.770
Huh?

14:31.680 --> 14:34.110
She's such a strange person.

14:34.110 --> 14:37.220
Why does she care so much about me?

14:37.220 --> 14:40.200
It doesn't feel like it's because it's her job.

14:41.450 --> 14:45.350
Apparently, her little sister at 
home is around the same age as you.

14:45.350 --> 14:47.190
Maybe she sees some of her in you?

14:47.560 --> 14:49.840
I see, that makes sense.

14:51.340 --> 14:54.450
Great Demon Lord, I have a question.

14:54.720 --> 14:55.760
What is it?

14:56.240 --> 15:01.460
Have you been sent by my family, the Evans?

15:02.810 --> 15:03.970
No.

15:04.240 --> 15:05.490
I see.

15:05.490 --> 15:07.700
I just wanted to check.

15:07.700 --> 15:10.100
You seem to dislike them.

15:10.100 --> 15:13.310
My parents are typical nobles-in-name-only.

15:13.310 --> 15:18.470
They're selfish snobs, 
a really horrible family.

15:20.480 --> 15:25.720
You study magic so earnestly so 
that you can leave your family?

15:26.100 --> 15:27.980
That's one of the reasons.

15:27.980 --> 15:31.980
If I can use magic, I can manage 
most of the stuff myself.

15:32.690 --> 15:33.870
I see.

15:33.870 --> 15:36.970
I understand that you've been through a lot.

15:37.430 --> 15:41.380
I read about your sister in the paper.

15:41.380 --> 15:44.490
Wasn't her name Charlotte...

15:46.210 --> 15:51.100
Please do not bring up that 
subject in front of me again.

15:51.100 --> 15:52.390
It puts me in a bad mood.

15:52.720 --> 15:54.880
Right... sorry.

15:55.510 --> 15:59.640
<i>I guess one small consolation is that 
Charlotte wasn't here to hear it.</i>

16:02.980 --> 16:07.140
Well, hello there. If it isn't Natalia.

16:07.140 --> 16:09.620
What do you want, Chris?

16:09.620 --> 16:13.150
Oh, I just thought I'd say hi.

16:13.150 --> 16:16.670
It seems that you bested 
those from the other class.

16:16.910 --> 16:18.260
Naturally.

16:18.260 --> 16:22.160
They're not even in my league.

16:22.160 --> 16:24.320
As expected of my rival.

16:24.320 --> 16:26.670
But don't get cocky.

16:27.360 --> 16:29.920
Your reign will soon end.

16:31.280 --> 16:34.160
Listen to the small yappy dog bark.

16:34.160 --> 16:37.600
If you want a duel with me, you 
need to make an appointment first.

16:37.600 --> 16:39.420
Don't you even know that common courtesy?

16:39.680 --> 16:42.290
You're stuck up as usual.

16:42.290 --> 16:43.810
Let's go, guys.

16:48.850 --> 16:50.860
Nice friend you got.

16:50.860 --> 16:52.210
Nice how?!

16:54.870 --> 16:57.460
O-Oh, I'm sorry.

16:57.460 --> 16:59.510
I'll clean up right away.

16:59.510 --> 17:01.590
Watch where you're going.

17:01.590 --> 17:04.210
You're in the way of young 
master Chris, get out—

17:04.210 --> 17:06.460
You scoundrels!

17:09.080 --> 17:10.840
N-Natalia!

17:12.740 --> 17:16.480
H-How dare you, those are my men!

17:16.800 --> 17:19.210
I taught them manners in your stead.

17:19.210 --> 17:21.470
You should be thanking me.

17:21.470 --> 17:22.470
Wha...?!

17:22.710 --> 17:25.110
To raise a hand against a woman 
is absolutely inexcusable!

17:25.110 --> 17:26.810
Forget the appointment!

17:26.810 --> 17:28.230
I'll strike you down right here—

17:29.670 --> 17:31.470
Come now, Natalia.

17:31.760 --> 17:32.990
Allen.

17:33.310 --> 17:34.990
This is a cafeteria.

17:34.990 --> 17:36.720
There are many students around.

17:37.200 --> 17:41.490
Causing a brawl here isn't 
exactly commendable.

17:41.490 --> 17:42.670
Huh?!

17:42.670 --> 17:44.840
But Charlo is your assistant!

17:44.840 --> 17:47.780
You're just going to stay 
quiet when she was hurt?!

17:48.990 --> 17:52.240
Um, I'm actually fine, so...

17:52.670 --> 17:56.020
That makes me laugh, actually.

17:58.080 --> 18:00.510
Whoever said I would forgive them?

18:00.510 --> 18:04.010
Oh no... I have a bad feeling about this.

18:13.600 --> 18:16.540
Wait... a subspace barrier?!

18:16.780 --> 18:18.250
What is this?!

18:18.250 --> 18:19.860
Did he create this thing?!

18:19.860 --> 18:20.840
Calm down!

18:20.840 --> 18:23.530
The weakness of this type 
of barrier is obvious!

18:23.900 --> 18:25.380
Attack the caster!

18:25.380 --> 18:26.550
Yes, sir!

18:28.870 --> 18:30.400
Listen, Natalia.

18:30.400 --> 18:32.800
There are three things to 
keep in mind in a fight.

18:40.840 --> 18:42.260
Oh no, Allen!

18:42.260 --> 18:43.920
You shouldn't fight!

18:44.150 --> 18:46.920
First, always block off the 
opponent's escape routes.

18:51.700 --> 18:55.140
Second, never miss any of the opponents.

19:01.000 --> 19:03.710
And the most important thing is to...

19:16.220 --> 19:22.470
Thoroughly break their souls so they will 
never think of opposing you again.

19:24.700 --> 19:27.220
I've never seen one this big...!

19:27.220 --> 19:29.220
Do you know what happens when you receive—

19:31.400 --> 19:32.200
What?!

19:44.070 --> 19:47.310
Fighting is beyond naughty!

19:53.940 --> 19:56.810
I'm grateful that you two were angry for me.

19:56.810 --> 19:59.600
But both of you have overdone it.

19:59.600 --> 20:01.500
Violence is not the answer!

20:01.870 --> 20:03.220
I'm sorry.

20:03.870 --> 20:05.760
You too, Natalia.

20:06.080 --> 20:07.920
Doing something so dangerous...

20:07.920 --> 20:10.260
What if you got hurt?!

20:10.530 --> 20:12.780
Then I can use magic to heal...

20:14.010 --> 20:15.460
I'm sorry.

20:16.200 --> 20:17.390
Listen to me.

20:17.390 --> 20:19.540
Fighting is a no-no!

20:19.870 --> 20:20.870
Okay...

20:25.450 --> 20:28.340
<i>Natalia seemed to be surprised,</i>

20:28.340 --> 20:32.140
<i>but I knew that Charlotte would 
succeed with that spell.</i>

20:32.540 --> 20:37.350
<i>And this experience will no doubt 
give her more self-confidence.</i>

20:37.980 --> 20:42.540
<i>That said, for her to hurl a spell 
at me and give me a talking-to...</i>

20:42.540 --> 20:46.900
<i>She couldn't even hit a punching bag 
before, but she's sure grown strong.</i>

20:48.000 --> 20:51.160
Why are you smiling? Creepy...

20:55.450 --> 20:58.000
No fighting, huh?

20:58.520 --> 21:01.390
You don't do it because you like it, do you?

21:02.430 --> 21:06.230
Initially, you were only 
helping vulnerable outcasts.

21:06.230 --> 21:11.150
But it grew into an army, and there 
were others who resented that.

21:11.660 --> 21:13.810
You investigated thoroughly.

21:13.810 --> 21:15.290
It's my job.

21:16.300 --> 21:20.850
I simply want to hone my craft here.

21:20.850 --> 21:22.780
I want to get stronger as soon as possible.

21:22.780 --> 21:27.680
To practice my skills, folks 
like Chris can be convenient targets.

21:28.320 --> 21:31.200
But they don't know when to give up,

21:31.200 --> 21:34.590
so the truth is that I find 
them annoying of late.

21:34.850 --> 21:38.510
I see, I'm starting to see 
the problem you have.

21:40.140 --> 21:42.600
Then there's only one thing you need to do.

21:43.010 --> 21:47.470
You're not going to tell me to 
get along with them, are you?

21:47.470 --> 21:50.860
No, just the opposite.

21:52.080 --> 21:56.250
Natalia, you must conquer this 
academy and become its ruler.

21:57.070 --> 21:58.170
Pardon me?

23:30.790 --> 23:33.620
Great Demon Lord, I want 
to ask you something.

23:33.620 --> 23:35.910
How do you feel about Charlo?

23:35.910 --> 23:36.770
Huh?! Well—

23:36.430 --> 23:40.050
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:36.430 --> 23:40.050
<b>Naughty Dungeon</b>

23:36.770 --> 23:38.310
Next time is, "Naughty Dungeon."

23:38.310 --> 23:40.110
So, Charlo is my... you know...
